{"text": "The banker took the paper from the table and read it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Tomorrow at twelve oclock I will be free, but before I leave this room, I must say a few words to you. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For fifteen years I have studied life on earth through books. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In your books I have climbed mountains, loved beautiful women, and spoken with great thinkers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And now I despise all your books, and I despise all the wisdom and blessings of this world. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everything is empty and false, like a dream, You may be proud and wise and beautiful, but death will wipe you off the earth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To show you how much I despise what you live for, I give up the two million. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I will leave here five hours before the time and so break our agreement. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The banker put the paper back on the table, kissed the strange man on the head, and went out of the lodge, weeping. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never before had he felt such deep contempt for himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The next morning, the watchman ran in and reported that the prisoner had climbed out of the window and disappeared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The banker went to the lodge, took the paper, and locked it in his safe.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "a", "n", "k", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", "o", "k", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "p", "e", "r", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "a", "b", "l", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "o", "m", "o", "r", "r", "o", "w", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "w", "e", "l", "v", "e", " ", "o", "c", "l", "o", "c", "k", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "b", "e", " ", "f", "r", "e", "e", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "I", 